The focus was a fast, mobile-first shopping experience for customers on everyday phones and connections, and a simple back office for the owner.', 'Sole developer — design, frontend, backend, deployment', '', 'Bangladesh', 'Shohoz Bazar', array['React','JavaScript','Tailwind CSS','Node.js']::text[], array['Product catalogue & categories','Search and filters','Cart and checkout','Order management','Mobile-first responsive UI','Deployed to a custom domain']::text[], 'https://shohazbazar.com', 'https://github.com/mrsharierkabir/Shohoz-Bazar', null, '{}'::text[], '#E8590C'),
  ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-100000000002', 2, true, true, 'mr-mart', 'M R Mart', 'E-commerce', 'web', 'A full e-commerce platform with product browsing, cart, checkout and an admin side for managing stock and orders.', 'M R Mart is a complete online-shop build: storefront, product pages, cart and checkout on the customer side, and product, stock and order management on the admin side. I developed it entirely on my own, focusing on a clean data model for products, orders and users.', 'Sole developer', '', 'Bangladesh', null, array['React','JavaScript','CSS','Supabase']::text[], array['Product listing & detail pages','Cart and checkout','Admin product & stock management','Order tracking','Responsive layout']::text[], null, 'https://github.com/mrsharierkabir/M-R-Mart', null, '{}'::text[], '#2F45FF'),
  ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-100000000003', 3, true, true, 'aakaar', 'AAKAAR', 'E-commerce · Fashion', 'web', 'A design-led online store — ''aakaar'' means ''shape'' in Bangla — built around a minimal, image-first shopping experience.', 'AAKAAR is an e-commerce storefront where the product photography does the talking. I built the full experience: collection pages, product detail with variants, cart and checkout, keeping the interface quiet and premium so the products stand out.', 'Sole developer', '', 'Bangladesh', null, array['React','JavaScript','Tailwind CSS']::text[], array['Collections & product variants','Image-first product pages','Cart and checkout','Minimal premium UI','Mobile-first']::text[], null, 'https://github.com/mrsharierkabir/AAKAAR', null, '{}'::text[], '#8A5A2B'),
  ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-100000000004', 4, true, true, 'dak', 'Dak', 'Communication app', 'mobile', 'A WhatsApp-style messaging app — one-to-one chat, real-time delivery and presence. ''Dak'' (ডাক) means ''call'' in Bangla.', 'Dak is a real-time communication app inspired by WhatsApp. Users sign in, find contacts and chat one-to-one with messages that arrive instantly, with delivery and read states and online presence. I built it end-to-end, from the auth and data model to the chat UI.', 'Sole developer', '', 'Bangladesh', null, array['Flutter','Dart','Firebase']::text[], array['Authentication','One-to-one real-time chat','Delivery & read receipts','Online presence','Contact list & search']::text[], null, 'https://github.com/mrsharierkabir/Dak', null, '{}'::text[], '#12A37F'),
  ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-100000000005', 5, true, false, 'hand-tracking-puzzle', 'Gesture Puzzle', 'Computer vision · Game', 'web', 'A 3×3 sliding puzzle you play with your hand — real-time gesture control in the browser with MediaPipe Hands.', 'A browser game controlled entirely by hand gestures through the webcam. It uses Google MediaPipe Hands for tracking, palm-relative pinch detection for ''grab'', and mirrored coordinates so movement feels natural. Hot paths use mutable refs instead of React state to hold 60fps.', 'Sole developer', '', null, null, array['React','Vite','Tailwind CSS','MediaPipe Hands']::text[], array['Real-time hand tracking','Pinch-to-grab gesture','60fps via ref-driven render loop','''Optical lab'' visual style']::text[], null, null, null, '{}'::text[], '#0EA5E9'),
  ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-100000000006', 6, true, false, 'marvelnodes', 'MarvelNodes', 'Web app · Data visualisation', 'web', 'Solves ''where do I start?'' for a 30+ film universe — pick any film and see its full prerequisite watch tree.', 'A React site that maps how films in a large interconnected franchise depend on each other. A searchable sidebar lists every film; choosing one draws its recursive, collapsible prerequisite hierarchy with arrows, so you know exactly what to watch first.', 'Sole developer', '', null, null, array['React','JavaScript','CSS animations']::text[], array['Searchable film list','Recursive prerequisite tree','Toggleable depth','Animated, joyful UI']::text[], null, null, null, '{}'::text[], '#D62839'),
  ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-100000000007', 7, true, false, 'dataharvest', 'DataHarvest', 'Python · Automation', 'web', 'Paste a link, get an Excel file — a multi-page web scraper with a simple UI that also follows detail pages.', 'DataHarvest turns multi-page listings (for example a trade association''s member directory) into a clean spreadsheet. It walks pagination, follows each detail page for extra fields, and exports everything to Excel from a simple web interface.', 'Sole developer', '', null, null, array['Python','Requests','BeautifulSoup','Pandas','Excel export']::text[], array['Pagination crawling','Detail-page enrichment','Excel export','Paste-a-link UI']::text[], null, null, null, '{}'::text[], '#15803D')
